---
import BoxExamples from './BoxExamples.astro'
---

<section class="box-running" aria-labelledby="box-running-title">
  <div class="box-running__inner">
    <header class="box-running__intro">
      <p class="box-running__eyebrow">Get running</p>
      <h2 id="box-running-title">Box the agent you already use.</h2>
      <p>Install Box, start with a working example, then narrow the boundary for your workload.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="box-running__steps">
      <article>
        <p class="box-running__label">/install</p>
        <h3>Install Box.</h3>
        <p>Run the installer for a supported platform.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="box-running__label">/configure</p>
        <h3>Set the boundary.</h3>
        <p>Define direct access in <code>box.toml</code> and mediated actions in <code>policy.dw</code>.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="box-running__label">/run</p>
        <h3>Review and refine.</h3>
        <p>Launch the workload, review refused requests, and add only the permits you intend.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <BoxExamples />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .box-running {
    --box-accent: var(--project-accent, var(--card-accent-purple));
    padding: var(--home-section-space) var(--home-gutter);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .box-running__inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .box-running__intro {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
  }

  .box-running__eyebrow,
  .box-running__label {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--box-accent);
  }

  .box-running__eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .box-running h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--home-heading-size);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: var(--home-heading-tracking);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .box-running__intro > p:last-child {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--home-body-size);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 68%, transparent);
  }

  .box-running__steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-block: 1px solid var(--home-rule);
  }

  .box-running__steps article {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 28px clamp(18px, 2.6vw, 34px);
  }

  .box-running__steps article:first-child {
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .box-running__steps article:last-child {
    padding-right: 0;
  }

  .box-running__steps article + article {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--home-rule);
  }

  .box-running h3 {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.2vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .box-running__steps article > p:last-child {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 68%, transparent);
  }

  .box-running__steps code {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.84em;
    color: var(--box-accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .box-running__steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .box-running__steps article {
      padding: 24px 0;
    }

    .box-running__steps article + article {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--home-rule);
      border-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
